{
  "name": "Syndicate - Strapi publish to social",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "Note s1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1900,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 820,
        "height": 400,
        "content": "## 2. Syndicate\n\nFires when an article is **published** in Strapi, not when it is drafted. Capture writes drafts; a human presses publish; this fans out.\n\nTrigger options, in order of preference:\n1. Strapi webhook (Settings > Webhooks) pointed at this workflow's production URL, event `entry.publish`.\n2. Manual Trigger with a slug, for testing and for back-filling anything already published.\n\nEvery publisher is OFF by default. Turn them on one at a time."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "name": "Strapi Publish Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1850,
        540
      ],
      "webhookId": "c2b8f6a3-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "strapi-publish",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "man",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1850,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "man-in",
      "name": "Manual Test Slug",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -1640,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "man-in-slug",
              "name": "slug",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "replace-with-a-published-slug"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "resolve",
      "name": "Resolve Slug",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1420,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Accepts either a Strapi webhook body or a manual { slug } input.\nconst j = $input.first().json;\nconst slug = j.slug\n  || j.entry?.slug\n  || j.body?.entry?.slug\n  || j.query?.slug\n  || '';\nconst event = j.event || j.body?.event || 'manual';\nif (!slug) {\n  throw new Error('No slug found. Strapi webhook body should contain entry.slug.');\n}\nreturn [{ json: { slug: String(slug), event } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fetch",
      "name": "Fetch Published Article",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1200,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ ($env.STRAPI_URL || '').replace(/\\/$/, '') + '/api/articles' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + ($env.STRAPI_API_TOKEN || '') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "filters[slug][$eq]",
              "value": "={{ $json.slug }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "populate[0]",
              "value": "cover"
            },
            {
              "name": "pagination[pageSize]",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "norm-art",
      "name": "Normalize Published Article",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -980,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.first().json.data;\nif (!Array.isArray(rows) || rows.length === 0) {\n  throw new Error('No published article found for that slug.');\n}\nconst a = rows[0];\nconst site = 'https://travnikov.dev';\nreturn [{ json: {\n  documentId: a.documentId,\n  title: a.title,\n  slug: a.slug,\n  excerpt: a.excerpt || '',\n  body: a.body || '',\n  tags: Array.isArray(a.tags) ? a.tags : [],\n  coverUrl: a.cover?.url || '',\n  url: site + '/blog/' + a.slug + '/',\n} }];"
      }
    },
